WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.736
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.006 --> 01:02.040
How are you?

3
01:02.040 --> 01:04.133
Fine, I guess. Seeing you cheat on me.

4
01:04.133 --> 01:07.800
If lawyers get involved, the police will find out the clip is AI-generated.

5
01:07.800 --> 01:10.496
I don't care if Nat gets the wrong idea.

6
01:10.496 --> 01:13.040
What worries me is that Nat was drugged.

7
01:13.040 --> 01:16.480
The herbalist said if Master Lert drinks too much,

8
01:16.480 --> 01:18.280
it could kill him.

9
01:18.280 --> 01:20.010
Your tonic, sir.

10
01:25.080 --> 01:27.353
Yo.

11
01:27.353 --> 01:28.360
You...

12
01:28.360 --> 01:30.715
drugged me.

13
01:38.680 --> 01:41.406
Thanks for understanding.

14
01:42.840 --> 01:45.040
I was angry at first.

15
01:45.040 --> 01:47.520
But your reasons make sense.

16
01:47.520 --> 01:50.080
The title deed may be in Yo's name,

17
01:50.080 --> 01:52.420
but you're the one who gets to use it.

18
02:02.619 --> 02:05.653
[Gift - Nat Thanahirankit] [Lifetime Usufruct]

19
02:15.040 --> 02:16.806
Let's have some fun.

20
02:45.200 --> 02:47.113
Why isn't Yo responding?

21
02:53.360 --> 02:54.613
Yo.

22
02:56.960 --> 03:00.958
Nat, did you give her too much?

23
03:00.958 --> 03:02.918
I gave her exactly what you told me.

24
03:02.918 --> 03:05.400
If you gave her what I told you to,

25
03:05.400 --> 03:08.700
she should be high and having fun with us.

26
03:08.700 --> 03:10.413
Unless...

27
03:12.320 --> 03:13.520
Yo!

28
03:13.520 --> 03:15.040
Yo!

29
03:15.040 --> 03:16.600
Yo!

30
03:16.600 --> 03:18.695
- Yo! - Yo! Don't die on me, Yo!

31
03:18.695 --> 03:19.810
- Yo! - Hey! Yo!

32
03:19.810 --> 03:21.520
- Yo! - Hey! Yo!

33
03:21.520 --> 03:23.500
We should get Yo to the hospital.

34
03:23.500 --> 03:26.120
No, Pam. If we take her there,

35
03:26.120 --> 03:28.920
everyone will know we drugged her.

36
03:28.920 --> 03:30.520
No. I'm scared.

37
03:30.520 --> 03:32.680
I'm scared we'll get arrested.

38
03:32.680 --> 03:34.413
What if Yo dies?

39
03:38.080 --> 03:39.620
No.

40
03:39.620 --> 03:41.220
I had nothing to do with this.

41
03:41.220 --> 03:42.913
This was your plan.

42
03:44.440 --> 03:45.640
Our plan?

43
03:45.640 --> 03:47.560
You're the one who drugged Yo.

44
03:47.560 --> 03:49.480
This is your fault.

45
03:49.480 --> 03:51.518
No. I had nothing to do with this.

46
03:51.518 --> 03:52.700
Nat!

47
03:54.840 --> 03:56.680
Pam, Nat's gone!

48
03:56.680 --> 03:59.413
He's going to pin all the blame on us!

49
04:00.320 --> 04:03.006
No. I won't let him.

50
04:19.040 --> 04:20.400
You choose.

51
04:20.400 --> 04:25.116
Will you fight back, or die like before, Kadkao?

52
04:32.960 --> 04:35.820
I'll make them all pay.

53
04:49.400 --> 04:51.100
Your tonic, sir.

54
05:06.480 --> 05:11.213
This tonic really works. Give some to Kadkao too.

55
05:13.800 --> 05:15.420
Yes, sir.

56
05:32.040 --> 05:34.610
Master is so kind to you, Kadkao.

57
05:36.320 --> 05:37.710
Drink it.

58
05:48.600 --> 05:50.226
Kadkao.

59
05:50.226 --> 05:51.818
What's wrong?

60
05:52.510 --> 05:53.826
Kadkao!

61
05:54.760 --> 05:56.113
Kadkao!

62
05:58.400 --> 05:59.713
Kadkao!

63
06:00.800 --> 06:02.116
Kadkao!

64
06:03.480 --> 06:08.125
The tonic you ordered may be too strong for Kadkao.

65
06:09.080 --> 06:12.906
If Kadkao dies, it'll be because you gave the order.

66
06:14.200 --> 06:15.626
Kadkao!

67
06:16.851 --> 06:18.215
Kadkao!

68
06:21.200 --> 06:22.840
Kadkao!

69
06:22.840 --> 06:25.318
Kadkao! Kadkao!

70
06:31.200 --> 06:33.605
Is anyone there? Come here!

71
06:36.480 --> 06:38.698
Go get the doctor.

72
06:38.698 --> 06:40.800
The Western doctor is out of town, sir.

73
06:40.800 --> 06:41.960
Damn it! Useless!

74
06:41.960 --> 06:43.816
I'll find another doctor myself.

75
07:02.200 --> 07:08.314
Sroi, get the servants to throw Kadkao's body to the vultures.

76
07:09.000 --> 07:10.304
Yes, ma'am.

77
07:31.280 --> 07:33.916
You want revenge, don't you?

78
07:39.160 --> 07:41.515
I'll help you.

79
07:52.800 --> 07:58.813
My lady, won't you bind Kadkao's soul like you did with Pan, Yohd, and Sali?

80
08:00.240 --> 08:01.813
Good idea.

81
08:09.640 --> 08:11.115
Drag her body away.

82
08:21.560 --> 08:24.916
Kadkao! You're still alive!

83
08:24.916 --> 08:28.115
Yeah... I'm still alive.

84
08:28.115 --> 08:30.609
You're the ones who are going to die.

85
08:35.400 --> 08:36.708
My lady!

86
08:41.720 --> 08:45.016
Help my lady! Hurry!

87
08:54.040 --> 08:55.600
Kadkao!

88
08:55.600 --> 08:57.705
You'll die all over again!

89
09:22.320 --> 09:25.311
You think you'll survive, Kadkao?

90
09:25.311 --> 09:27.121
Here, my lady!

91
09:52.320 --> 09:55.302
You'll suffer a hundred, a thousand times more than I did.

92
10:01.416 --> 10:04.718
Is Kadkao a ghost?

93
10:06.400 --> 10:08.760
That's right... I'm a ghost.

94
10:08.760 --> 10:11.198
I've come to take revenge on all of you!

95
10:11.800 --> 10:16.080
My lady, run! Go! Go!

96
10:16.080 --> 10:17.520
Watch out!

97
10:25.710 --> 10:27.480
Bulan!

98
10:27.480 --> 10:28.602
Sroi!

99
10:29.200 --> 10:31.280
I'll never let you live in peace!

100
10:39.080 --> 10:40.720
I won't let Yo die.

101
10:40.720 --> 10:42.721
[Dr. Mote]

102
10:47.560 --> 10:49.305
Pick up, Doctor!

103
10:51.200 --> 10:52.921
Why aren't you answering?

104
11:00.700 --> 11:02.423
Why aren't you answering?

105
11:19.880 --> 11:23.105
You... drugged me.

106
11:31.560 --> 11:33.005
Bulan!

107
11:33.920 --> 11:35.200
Sroi!

108
11:35.200 --> 11:36.814
Where are you?

109
11:37.444 --> 11:39.674
I stabbed her twice!

110
11:39.674 --> 11:41.517
How can she still be alive?

111
11:42.640 --> 11:44.735
But she died, ma'am.

112
11:44.735 --> 11:46.808
Kadkao is a ghost.

113
12:27.680 --> 12:29.099
Don't, Bulan!

114
12:41.560 --> 12:42.905
Kadkao.

115
12:45.280 --> 12:46.807
You're still alive.

116
12:51.360 --> 12:53.114
Why are you looking at me like that?

117
13:04.160 --> 13:06.040
Kadkao is already dead.

118
13:06.040 --> 13:07.709
This is a ghost!

119
13:08.680 --> 13:10.160
A ghost?

120
13:10.160 --> 13:12.810
Yes. We're ghosts.

121
13:15.000 --> 13:16.240
Pan!

122
13:16.240 --> 13:18.205
Yohd! Sali!

123
13:20.000 --> 13:21.680
Yeah... it's us.

124
13:21.680 --> 13:24.560
Today, you're all going to die!

125
13:24.560 --> 13:25.897
Kadkao,

126
13:27.132 --> 13:29.160
I love you.

127
13:29.160 --> 13:31.400
Don't let them take over!

128
13:38.960 --> 13:40.332
Don't believe him!

129
13:40.332 --> 13:42.520
How many times has he fooled you, you idiot?

130
13:42.520 --> 13:44.497
You have to take revenge!

131
13:55.040 --> 13:56.492
Kadkao's possessed...

132
13:56.492 --> 13:58.108
Restrain her!

133
13:58.108 --> 14:03.026
Anyone there? Come help! Restrain Kadkao! Hurry!

134
14:03.026 --> 14:05.887
Come on! Just try it!

135
14:05.887 --> 14:07.240
Restrain her!

136
14:07.240 --> 14:08.514
Hurry!

137
14:14.200 --> 14:15.922
Get something to tie her up!

138
14:20.160 --> 14:21.707
Let me go!

139
14:29.760 --> 14:31.106
Kill her!

140
14:33.400 --> 14:34.697
Don't!

141
14:34.697 --> 14:36.112
Master!

142
14:36.760 --> 14:38.680
Are you going to let her kill us?

143
14:38.680 --> 14:40.767
You know that's not Kadkao!

144
14:40.767 --> 14:41.920
That's exactly why.

145
14:41.920 --> 14:43.908
No one is to harm Kadkao.

146
14:45.480 --> 14:48.022
You really want to challenge me?

147
14:48.022 --> 14:50.810
- Go get Shaman Kham. - Yes, sir! Let's go! Hurry!

148
14:51.439 --> 14:54.320
This time, I'll bind your souls,

149
14:54.320 --> 14:58.505
so you'll never be reborn, not in a billion lifetimes!

150
15:29.040 --> 15:30.547
Hey, Doctor.

151
15:30.547 --> 15:32.100
What's up, Nat?

152
15:33.000 --> 15:34.560
I accidentally gave Yo some drugs.

153
15:34.560 --> 15:37.505
She's unconscious. What should I do?

154
15:38.200 --> 15:40.480
Get her to a hospital now.

155
15:40.480 --> 15:41.920
I can't.

156
15:41.920 --> 15:43.104
Why not?

157
15:44.560 --> 15:47.008
I gave her too much of a date rape drug.

158
15:47.008 --> 15:50.120
Doctor, you have to help me. I don't want Yo to die.

159
15:50.120 --> 15:55.391
It can suppress her breathing and severely affect her nervous system.

160
15:55.391 --> 15:58.417
The only way to save her is to get her to a hospital now.

161
15:58.417 --> 16:03.280
If her heart stops, start CPR and get her pulse back.

162
16:03.280 --> 16:05.017
Thanks, Doctor.

163
17:15.360 --> 17:16.400
Hello, Yo.

164
17:16.400 --> 17:18.117
What is it, Officer?

165
17:20.840 --> 17:23.200
Can I speak to Yo?

166
17:23.200 --> 17:24.600
Yo's asleep.

167
17:24.600 --> 17:27.414
And we're back together now.

168
17:27.414 --> 17:29.303
Stay away from Yo.

169
17:30.200 --> 17:31.912
Why should I believe you?

170
17:33.600 --> 17:36.610
Because I'm Yo's legal husband.

171
17:55.920 --> 17:57.499
Take care of this case for me.

172
18:02.200 --> 18:03.512
Something wrong?

173
18:05.120 --> 18:07.450
I just checked my home security camera.

174
18:07.450 --> 18:08.603
Yo wasn't there.

175
18:08.603 --> 18:10.200
And when I called her,

176
18:10.200 --> 18:12.115
Nat answered instead.

177
18:13.720 --> 18:15.402
Something doesn't feel right.

178
18:36.200 --> 18:38.013
What did you do to Yo?

179
18:40.640 --> 18:42.604
Mind your own business.

180
18:45.120 --> 18:47.705
You're the one who should stay away from Yo.

181
18:58.240 --> 18:59.600
If anything happens to Yo,

182
18:59.600 --> 19:01.685
you'll be facing charges.

183
19:01.685 --> 19:03.280
I'll have you arrested!

184
19:03.280 --> 19:05.413
For police brutality!

185
19:06.320 --> 19:08.227
Go right ahead.

186
19:08.227 --> 19:11.306
I'll testify that you attacked Pete first.

187
19:30.920 --> 19:33.808
Pam, are we going to get arrested?

188
19:34.480 --> 19:36.142
Yo's not dead.

189
19:36.142 --> 19:37.813
What would they arrest us for?

190
19:45.120 --> 19:47.796
[Intensive Care Unit]

191
19:47.796 --> 19:53.603
[ICU 3 - Yotaka Thanahirankit] [Dr. Atchariya Pengyasa]

192
20:11.040 --> 20:12.598
How's Yo?

193
20:13.228 --> 20:16.118
The doctor says they still need to monitor her.

194
20:18.320 --> 20:19.624
If she was drugged,

195
20:19.624 --> 20:21.905
it may already be out of her system.

196
20:22.840 --> 20:25.000
We'll have to rely on physical evidence instead.

197
20:25.000 --> 20:28.696
If we find any evidence, those three are going down.

198
20:46.600 --> 20:48.800
I'll press charges against all of you!

199
20:48.800 --> 20:52.014
You can't just barge in and search someone's home!

200
20:52.014 --> 20:56.720
Under Section 92 (2) and (4) of the Criminal Procedure Code,

201
20:56.720 --> 21:00.200
officers may conduct a search without a warrant

202
21:00.200 --> 21:02.557
if there's reasonable cause to believe

203
21:02.557 --> 21:06.812
key evidence may be moved or concealed.

204
21:09.145 --> 21:10.905
Please cooperate with us.

205
21:25.440 --> 21:28.582
Whan, go keep an eye on them.

206
21:28.582 --> 21:32.413
They might plant something illegal.

207
21:35.280 --> 21:36.411
Okay.

208
21:47.400 --> 21:48.877
I knew Yo wasn't dying.

209
21:48.877 --> 21:53.045
She just fainted, but you took her to the hospital.

210
21:53.045 --> 21:57.760
The results of Yo's tests are in.

211
21:57.760 --> 22:00.082
The drug she was given

212
22:00.082 --> 22:01.760
damaged her nervous system

213
22:01.760 --> 22:04.230
and suppressed her breathing,

214
22:04.230 --> 22:07.797
depriving her brain of oxygen.

215
22:08.880 --> 22:11.101
She's now in a coma.

216
22:15.720 --> 22:19.582
You don't have to tell me now what drug you gave Yo.

217
22:19.582 --> 22:23.010
Wait until the police finish gathering the evidence.

218
22:23.720 --> 22:25.503
Until then,

219
22:26.170 --> 22:32.302
all three of you will have to testify during the investigation and in court.

220
23:21.600 --> 23:25.080
The doctor said Yo is out of danger.

221
23:25.080 --> 23:27.117
But they still need to monitor her

222
23:27.920 --> 23:30.404
and wait for her to regain consciousness.

223
23:30.404 --> 23:32.707
Her body may be recovering,

224
23:32.707 --> 23:34.411
but the reason she hasn't woken up

225
23:34.411 --> 23:37.807
may be that her spirit is no longer in her body.

226
23:39.360 --> 23:41.194
You mean...

227
23:42.080 --> 23:47.360
Yo's spirit has gone back to the past

228
23:47.360 --> 23:51.004
to settle the resentment that still haunts her.

229
23:51.004 --> 23:54.120
We shouldn't let her remain separated from her body for too long.

230
23:54.120 --> 23:56.090
Please help Yo.

231
23:56.090 --> 23:58.405
I'll do everything I can.

232
23:59.000 --> 24:01.577
As I've always told you,

233
24:01.577 --> 24:04.322
we can't change anyone's fate.

234
24:04.322 --> 24:06.823
Everything happens because of causes and conditions.

235
24:08.120 --> 24:09.822
We each bear our own karma.

236
24:25.120 --> 24:26.640
Yo.

237
24:26.640 --> 24:28.514
If you can hear me,

238
24:29.680 --> 24:32.005
wherever you are right now,

239
24:33.200 --> 24:35.219
please come back, Yo.

240
24:45.440 --> 24:46.889
Shaman Kham.

241
24:46.889 --> 24:48.400
Do whatever it takes.

242
24:48.400 --> 24:50.814
Don't let them come back to haunt me again.

243
25:16.480 --> 25:19.038
With this Sacred Temple Nail,

244
25:19.038 --> 25:22.139
I'll bind your souls again so you can never escape,

245
25:22.139 --> 25:24.919
never to be reborn for all eternity.

246
25:27.200 --> 25:29.396
You took my life,

247
25:29.396 --> 25:31.200
and now you want to trap my soul too!

248
25:31.200 --> 25:32.800
You bastards!

249
26:25.920 --> 26:27.760
If you're sending me to hell,

250
26:27.760 --> 26:30.114
you'll have to lead the way!

251
26:50.040 --> 26:51.800
My lord,

252
26:51.800 --> 26:54.807
it killed Shaman Kham! We have to run!

253
27:21.360 --> 27:22.982
Lert!

254
27:22.982 --> 27:24.125
Bulan!

255
27:24.125 --> 27:25.523
Sroi!

256
27:26.360 --> 27:28.680
Even if you had wings,

257
27:28.680 --> 27:30.717
you'll never escape me!

258
28:05.000 --> 28:06.305
Yo.

259
28:08.440 --> 28:10.656
Return to your body. Now!

260
28:10.656 --> 28:11.915
No!

261
28:12.600 --> 28:14.720
I have to take revenge.

262
28:14.720 --> 28:19.621
The guilty will be punished, but those three ghosts are using you.

263
28:20.880 --> 28:23.400
None of your business, Chan!

264
28:23.400 --> 28:28.120
Maybe not, but you're creating karma by using someone else!

265
28:28.120 --> 28:32.000
Believe me. They're using you.

266
28:32.000 --> 28:33.720
Look at Kadkao.

267
28:33.720 --> 28:35.560
She's already dead.

268
28:35.560 --> 28:37.899
They forced your spirit

269
28:37.899 --> 28:39.707
to possess Kadkao's body.

270
28:41.000 --> 28:43.200
Don't you pity the dead?

271
28:44.237 --> 28:46.128
Don't listen to him!

272
28:46.128 --> 28:48.514
You have to take revenge!

273
28:48.514 --> 28:52.297
They're evil. No matter the lifetime, you must pay for your karma!

274
28:52.960 --> 28:54.807
Don't listen to them, Yo!

275
28:54.807 --> 28:57.309
Go back before it's too late!

276
28:59.480 --> 29:01.123
Butt out!

277
29:08.320 --> 29:09.880
You're trying to kill me?

278
29:09.880 --> 29:12.680
After everything I've done for you?

279
29:12.680 --> 29:15.320
And you dragged Yo into this to take revenge for you!

280
29:15.320 --> 29:17.413
You wretched ghosts!

281
29:20.000 --> 29:21.213
Chan!

282
29:22.600 --> 29:24.410
Don't hurt him!

283
29:28.360 --> 29:29.819
Stop!

284
29:36.000 --> 29:37.302
Uncle!

285
29:49.280 --> 29:51.226
- Yo. - Uncle!

286
29:51.226 --> 29:53.626
Uncle... Why did you hurt him?

287
29:53.626 --> 29:58.213
He got in my way. Anyone who gets in my way dies.

288
29:59.920 --> 30:02.321
You damned ghosts!

289
30:04.480 --> 30:07.760
Uncle Chan! Get up!

290
30:07.760 --> 30:10.000
You have to join us.

291
30:10.000 --> 30:12.040
Make Lert suffer for what he did!

292
30:12.040 --> 30:13.520
No!

293
30:31.440 --> 30:32.851
Yo.

294
30:32.851 --> 30:34.118
Yo.

295
30:36.800 --> 30:38.411
Yo, can you hear me?

296
30:41.040 --> 30:42.816
It's time to come back.

297
30:46.280 --> 30:47.807
Come back, Yo.

298
30:48.440 --> 30:50.111
Can you hear me?

299
30:52.240 --> 30:53.315
No!

300
31:17.320 --> 31:19.539
Master Lert.

301
31:19.539 --> 31:21.509
Please help me.

302
31:24.200 --> 31:26.631
I'm still alive, sir.

303
31:26.631 --> 31:29.017
I'm not a ghost.

304
31:32.360 --> 31:36.416
Don't believe her. She's a ghost!

305
31:41.560 --> 31:43.205
Master Lert...

306
31:45.200 --> 31:48.407
You're in this room, aren't you?

307
31:49.280 --> 31:51.714
Don't you love me anymore?

308
31:52.720 --> 31:55.520
Please come out to me.

309
31:58.440 --> 32:01.280
Don't believe her.

310
32:01.280 --> 32:03.517
The ghosts are trying to lure us out.

311
32:08.520 --> 32:10.718
Where are you, Master Lert?

312
32:11.614 --> 32:13.118
Master Lert.

313
32:17.120 --> 32:19.106
- Please help me. - Master!

314
32:21.280 --> 32:23.893
Kadkao... Kadkao.

315
32:29.200 --> 32:30.512
Kadkao.

316
32:43.800 --> 32:45.413
Master Lert.

317
32:53.240 --> 32:54.718
Master Lert...

318
33:33.880 --> 33:35.525
You tricked me!

319
33:36.640 --> 33:39.600
I'll find a powerful shaman to banish every last one of you!

320
33:39.600 --> 33:42.325
Then I can finally leave this cursed house!

321
33:46.040 --> 33:48.322
Go ahead and run, Lert!

322
33:49.120 --> 33:54.507
As long as our souls stay trapped here,

323
33:57.360 --> 34:02.065
we will hunt you down and haunt you

324
34:02.065 --> 34:05.117
until you all return here to die!

325
34:44.000 --> 34:45.315
Kadkao!

326
34:48.813 --> 34:50.120
Kadkao!

327
34:50.120 --> 34:51.509
Kadkao!

328
34:55.320 --> 34:56.610
Kadkao...

329
34:57.480 --> 34:59.200
I love you, Kadkao.

330
34:59.200 --> 35:01.614
Don't leave me like this...

331
35:02.360 --> 35:03.800
Kadkao!

332
35:08.200 --> 35:10.497
I'll find a way to bring you back.

333
35:23.360 --> 35:25.517
You shouldn't have done this.

334
35:26.360 --> 35:27.961
Aren't you the one

335
35:27.961 --> 35:30.982
who couldn't leave your idiot wife?

336
35:30.982 --> 35:32.508
And don't forget...

337
35:33.200 --> 35:35.712
you're the one who drugged her.

338
35:37.400 --> 35:39.035
Whan made me do it!

339
35:39.035 --> 35:42.958
I told you to use a little, not overdose her!

340
35:42.958 --> 35:44.000
I don't care.

341
35:44.000 --> 35:47.407
If anything happens to Yo, I'm going to the police!

342
35:48.800 --> 35:50.606
Me too.

343
35:53.280 --> 35:55.600
Me too!

344
35:55.600 --> 35:58.666
I'm just an employee! You two dragged me into this!

345
35:58.666 --> 36:00.612
Fine! Go to the police!

346
36:00.612 --> 36:03.000
Then we can all rot in jail!

347
36:03.000 --> 36:04.900
Will you two shut up?

348
36:05.663 --> 36:09.813
Instead of finding a way out, all you do is panic about jail!

349
36:17.800 --> 36:19.120
Yo!

350
36:27.600 --> 36:29.905
Why are you staring at me like that?

351
36:31.400 --> 36:34.808
Aren't you glad to see me recovered?

352
36:39.280 --> 36:44.918
Or were you hoping I'd stay put until they found the drugs in my system?

353
36:50.120 --> 36:52.720
I'm just glad you're okay, Yo.

354
36:52.720 --> 36:54.822
I was so worried about you.

355
37:07.293 --> 37:08.746
She's better already?

356
37:08.746 --> 37:11.405
She clearly just wanted Nat's attention.

357
37:18.886 --> 37:20.924
I woke up and no one was there.

358
37:21.840 --> 37:24.217
All I wanted was to come home.

359
37:26.480 --> 37:28.311
I'm sorry, Yo.

360
37:30.240 --> 37:34.115
We still have a lot of unfinished business.

361
37:42.080 --> 37:44.111
Let me pour us a drink.

362
38:09.800 --> 38:11.565
What's gotten into you?

363
38:11.565 --> 38:14.112
I've never seen you drink.

364
38:16.880 --> 38:18.720
I just feel like drinking today.

365
38:18.720 --> 38:22.200
You can spike my drink like you did last time.

366
38:22.200 --> 38:24.214
Then we can have some real fun.

367
38:30.160 --> 38:31.421
How does that sound?

368
38:49.640 --> 38:51.915
I'll be waiting for you in our room.

369
38:54.000 --> 38:55.616
Don't keep me waiting.

370
39:04.240 --> 39:06.811
Your wife isn't up to something, is she?

371
39:07.819 --> 39:10.907
Yo seems strange to me too. I'll handle her.

372
39:19.600 --> 39:21.413
What should we do, Pam?

373
39:23.480 --> 39:25.240
I don't know.

374
39:25.240 --> 39:27.614
Let's play along with her for now.

375
39:50.520 --> 39:52.995
Please forgive me, Yo.

376
39:52.995 --> 39:55.417
I promise I'll never do this again.

377
40:00.800 --> 40:03.604
You once told me you loved me so much.

378
40:05.400 --> 40:07.213
Then prove it.

379
40:07.924 --> 40:11.305
Between the two women who were in on it with you,

380
40:12.680 --> 40:14.508
one is your mistress,

381
40:15.320 --> 40:17.404
the other is your servant.

382
40:18.280 --> 40:20.920
Which one will you deal with first?

383
40:28.720 --> 40:30.617
Can't choose?

384
40:32.600 --> 40:34.208
Then...

385
40:38.000 --> 40:39.931
I choose you...

386
40:39.931 --> 40:43.008
my dear husband.

387
40:49.160 --> 40:50.320
Yo!

388
40:56.680 --> 40:57.880
Yo!

389
40:59.000 --> 41:00.200
Yo...

390
41:02.240 --> 41:03.806
Yo... don't!

391
41:13.600 --> 41:14.912
Yo...

392
41:20.720 --> 41:22.610
Keep your voice down.

393
41:23.600 --> 41:26.205
Or hell might find you.

394
41:36.720 --> 41:37.880
Help me!

395
41:37.880 --> 41:41.413
- Focus your mind. Think only of Yo. - Help me!

396
41:42.000 --> 41:43.120
Go back!

397
41:43.120 --> 41:44.880
Have you never loved me, Master?

398
41:44.880 --> 41:47.480
Kadkao is the only one in my heart.

399
41:47.480 --> 41:49.000
What did Kadkao ever do to you?

400
41:49.000 --> 41:50.760
She's Lert's heart.

401
41:50.760 --> 41:52.920
No matter the lifetime, I'll always love this woman.

402
41:52.920 --> 41:54.080
No! No!

403
41:54.080 --> 41:55.160
I'd rather die!

404
41:55.160 --> 41:58.315
All you'll get from me is vengeance.

405
41:58.893 --> 42:00.680
Will you cut it yourself,

406
42:00.680 --> 42:02.613
or do you want me to do it?
